        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As our industry continues to evolve, we expect our business will grow to serve new end markets, such as on-orbit edge computing and large-scale orbital infrastructure, including for our own Starlab Space Stations segment.",
        "start_character": 13885,
        "end_character": 14106
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are subject to industry-specific regulations due to the nature of the products and services we provide.",
        "start_character": 34949,
        "end_character": 35068
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our commercial space mission management business, operated through Nanoracks, we compete with other ISS utilization and payload services providers as well as emerging commercial operators seeking to offer research and mission services on orbit.",
        "start_character": 27739,
        "end_character": 27986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our portfolio has managed and executed more than 1,400 missions to the International Space Station across scientific experiments and payload operations, and in September 2025, the multi-cloud region we developed was launched to the ISS as the first known space cloud infrastructure in space.",
        "start_character": 1537,
        "end_character": 1828
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Though we were built to address this growing need, many of our competitors are substantially larger than we are and may be able to adapt more quickly to changing technology or market conditions or may be able to devote greater resources to the development, promotion and sale of their products, which may make it more difficult for us to execute on our business and growth strategies.",
        "start_character": 6757,
        "end_character": 7141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are actively evolving our business model to reflect this shift, building on our track record of mission execution to offer more comprehensive, cross-domain solutions that combine our hardware capabilities with software, analytics and mission management services.",
        "start_character": 23737,
        "end_character": 24002
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to state and local laws designed to limit the use or other processing of personal information gathered online and that require online services to establish privacy policies.",
        "start_character": 37307,
        "end_character": 37500
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate an agile and entrepreneurial business model positioned to rapidly develop and iterate technologies to meet the evolving needs of our defense, national security and space customers.",
        "start_character": 8953,
        "end_character": 9144
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide integrated hardware and software systems and engineering services to NASA, the DoD and commercial customers, including in-space propulsion systems with applications for orbital servicing, manufacturing and deep space exploration.",
        "start_character": 16680,
        "end_character": 16920
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain energetic materials are supply-constrained within the United States, and we believe our manufacturing capacity strengthens the resiliency of the U.S.",
        "start_character": 11341,
        "end_character": 11498
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Classified programs generally will require that we comply with various Executive Orders, federal laws and regulations and customer security requirements that may include restrictions on how we develop, store, protect and share information, and may require our employees to obtain government clearances.",
        "start_character": 34646,
        "end_character": 34948
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016543",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016543-fa429f41e51d7cdc",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016543",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we are developing AI-powered edge computing units layered with Palantir's operating system and our intelligence analytics platform to deliver real-time capabilities for both defense and space applications.",
